# 01 · Getting started with Biotech.Net

**EN** — Biotech.Net is a biotechnology and bioinformatics platform for .NET 10 (think Bioconductor + Biopython), with Rust-accelerated kernels. This notebook loads the packages, turns on the rich notebook formatters and shows the core types.

**ID** — Biotech.Net adalah platform bioteknologi dan bioinformatika untuk .NET 10 (seperti Bioconductor + Biopython) dengan kernel yang dipercepat Rust. Notebook ini memuat paket, mengaktifkan formatter notebook, dan memperkenalkan tipe-tipe inti.

*Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil*

#!csharp

#r "nuget: Gravicode.Biotech.Net.Notebooks, 0.2.0"
// Local build instead of NuGet (run `dotnet build Biotech.Net.slnx` first), comment the line above and use:
// #r "../src/Biotech.Net.Notebooks/bin/Debug/net10.0/Biotech.Net.Notebooks.dll"

#!csharp

using Biotech.Net.Core;
using Biotech.Net.Notebooks;

BiotechFormatters.Register();   // also runs automatically when the NuGet package is loaded
BiotechInfo.Banner

#!markdown

## Sequences · Sekuens

A `Sequence` keeps ASCII bytes; the formatter colours bases and shows length and GC.
Sebuah `Sequence` menyimpan byte ASCII; formatter mewarnai basa dan menampilkan panjang serta GC.

#!csharp

var dna = Sequence.Dna("ATGGCCATTGTAATGGGCCGCTGAAAGGGTGCCCGATAG", "demo", "toy open reading frame");
dna

#!csharp

dna.ReverseComplement()

#!csharp

dna.Translate(toStop: true)

#!markdown

## Proteins, intervals and variants · Protein, interval, dan varian

Coordinates: `GenomicInterval` is 0-based half-open; `Variant.Position` is 1-based like VCF.
Koordinat: `GenomicInterval` berbasis 0 setengah-terbuka; `Variant.Position` berbasis 1 seperti VCF.

#!csharp

Protein.FromString("P69905", "MVLSPADKTNVKAAWGKVGAHAGEYGAEALERMFLSFPTTKTYFPHFDLSHGSAQVKGHGKKVADALTNAVAHVDDMPNALSALSDLHAHKLRVDPVNFKLLSHCLLVTLAAHLPAEFTPAVHASLDKFLASVSTVLTSKYR", "Hemoglobin subunit alpha")

#!csharp

GenomicInterval.Parse("chr17:7,668,402-7,687,550:-")

#!csharp

new Variant("chr7", 117559590, "ATCT", "A", "rs113993960") { Quality = 99 }

#!markdown

## Datasets · Dataset

#!csharp

var counts = Dataset.FromArray("counts", new double[,] { { 10, 12, 80, 95 }, { 300, 280, 310, 290 }, { 5, 0, 40, 33 } },
    ["geneA", "geneB", "geneC"], ["ctl1", "ctl2", "trt1", "trt2"]);
counts.Annotate("condition", "ctl", "ctl", "trt", "trt");
counts
